クラコ様それは流行じゃありません！！」と叫んでいるマリーのセリフを入れていて欲しいです。\n\n　描いていただければ嬉しいです！", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@amtkmituki/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 114182, "client_id": 2919614, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/443c6444/uploads/origins/fce1c9c9-02db-4975-872e-e1e201a88fa9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ba03c4e2566c90ff3b9bdae5014dc3f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/443c6444/uploads/origins/fce1c9c9-02db-4975-872e-e1e201a88fa9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ba03c4e2566c90ff3b9bdae5014dc3f, https://si.imgix.net/443c6444/uploads/origins/fce1c9c9-02db-4975-872e-e1e201a88fa9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd304ac405c45e37290034ae15f2d0c2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/443c6444/uploads/origins/fce1c9c9-02db-4975-872e-e1e201a88fa9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=055dfe06b4af9f411f32c5ca72a26cb1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/443c6444/uploads/origins/fce1c9c9-02db-4975-872e-e1e201a88fa9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=920f4d8b350285f50227185217d38b77", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/443c6444/uploads/origins/fce1c9c9-02db-4975-872e-e1e201a88fa9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=920f4d8b350285f50227185217d38b77, https://si.imgix.net/443c6444/uploads/origins/fce1c9c9-02db-4975-872e-e1e201a88fa9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=94e4c0437a474586e205317041a860ef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/443c6444/uploads/origins/fce1c9c9-02db-4975-872e-e1e201a88fa9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=web